{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 49, :comments ["<b>Only the tribe of Levi.</b> Even though I said, \"Take the sum of all the congregation of the children of Israel\" (Numbers 1:2) — and the Levites are included among them to be counted as well — nevertheless they are separated from the rest of the people of Israel first in the matter of the census, so that the number of their persons and their total not be combined with the rest." "<b>You shall not number.</b> The count of their persons shall not be from twenty years old and upward, as was the count of the rest of the people." "<b>And their heads you shall not lift up.</b> When you make the total of all those counted of the tribes, the total of the tribe of Levi shall not enter into it."], :book :numbers, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:38:34.339440908Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}